{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1345136-what-do-you-think-of-these-ideas-for-aberrant","id":1345136,"title":"What do you think of these ideas for Aberrant?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-31T18:35:06-07:00","id":1345136,"title":"What do you think of these ideas for Aberrant?","content":"1. Replacing the character of Alejandra from the original book with Ariana Grande. Other than the fact that Alejandra was really virginal and Ariana isn\u2019t, they have a lot of similarities.<br /> <br /> 2. Creating a clandestine romance between Slider and Andre Corbin. I know the original book says they were just friends, but you don\u2019t go to the extraordinary lengths Corbin did for someone who\u2019s \u201cjust a friend.\u201d And they would probably keep it a secret because she\u2019s in Team Tomorrow and he\u2019s in Team Tonight (plus they have the whole good girl-bad boy thing going on).<br /> <br /> I don\u2019t think either of these ideas directly contradicts anything in the new Aberrant book. What do you guys think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T12:09:40-07:00","id":1345291,"title":"","content":"You could certainly do these things in your home games with no problem though I doubt they'll make any such changes in the new book. I'm pretty sure there's legal concerns to using a known celebrity in supplements, so that's probably not going to be touched. And the only reason the Corbin/Slider relationship was even noteworthy in 1E was the whole sterilization plot, which they aren't using this time around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T12:27:46-07:00","id":1345300,"title":"","content":"I understand about the legal issues. I was just suggesting it for the campaign I'm gonna be playing in when Aberrant finally comes out. And I totally forgot about the sterilization plot. I just liked the whole forbidden romance aspect. What do you think about that part of it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-02T07:28:26-07:00","id":1345434,"title":"","content":"<ul><li> <img src=\"https://images.girlsaskguys.com/users/1f4ff5239164f792b0b16f8497e0405d/thumb.jpg?17\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <a href=\"https://www.girlsaskguys.com/user/sydneysentinel\" target=\"_blank\">SydneySentinel</a> [COLOR=rgba(51, 77, 94, 0.8)]<span style=\"font-size:12px\">Explorer Age 31</span>[/COLOR]<br /> <br /> <div align=\"right\">[COLOR=rgba(51, 77, 94, 0.8)]<span style=\"font-size:12px\">16 h</span>[/COLOR] <br /> </div> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\">I haven't read the Abrrrant book but I like the ideas! Extraordinary lengths, yes!</span><br /> <br /> <div align=\"right\"><span style=\"color:#334D5E\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Reply</span></span></div></li> <li> <img src=\"https://images.girlsaskguys.com/users/ebfa5deba1b1d524b6b6b91d59a96d8c/thumb.jpg?1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <a href=\"https://www.girlsaskguys.com/user/whiteshoulder\" target=\"_blank\">WhiteShoulder</a> [COLOR=rgba(51, 77, 94, 0.8)]<span style=\"font-size:12px\">Yoda Age 25</span>[/COLOR]<br /> <br /> <div align=\"right\">[COLOR=rgba(51, 77, 94, 0.8)]<span style=\"font-size:12px\">16 h</span>[/COLOR]</div> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a href=\"https://www.girlsaskguys.com/user/sydneysentinel\" target=\"_blank\">@SydneySentinel</a> Corbin took on an international conspiracy to prove that Jen (Slider) had been murdered. She\u2019s not dead anymore in the new book, but I like the idea that his feelings for her still endure.</span></li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-02T13:14:34-07:00","id":1345465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1345136-what-do-you-think-of-these-ideas-for-aberrant?p=1345300#post1345300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I understand about the legal issues. I was just suggesting it for the campaign I'm gonna be playing in when Aberrant finally comes out. And I totally forgot about the sterilization plot. I just liked the whole forbidden romance aspect. What do you think about that part of it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Forbidden romance is always a good thing to involve, but to make it have teeth, you'd need to do a bit more explaining/adding to what makes it forbidden, and what could happen when the inevitable occurs and one or both of them are tempted to choose the romance over their---duty? something else?---and somehow things go sideways. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2176-spectaculartentacular","name":"SpectacularTentacular","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2176_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-02T13:25:59-07:00","id":1345467,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2176-spectaculartentacular\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2176_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2176\" data-vbnamecard=\"2176\">SpectacularTentacular</a> thank you! That\u2019s a very good point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T07:54:07-08:00","id":1356097,"title":"","content":"I was talking to my friend last night and she suggested what if Corbin had another official girlfriend (maybe a nova or even a Talent) and that's why they have to keep it a secret.<br /> <br /> I kind of like it. What do you guys think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T01:11:05-08:00","id":1356452,"title":"","content":"For extra points with that one, make the &quot;forbidden lover&quot; a part of an opposing faction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T03:35:49-08:00","id":1356463,"title":"","content":"I love it!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-25T17:41:34-08:00","id":1356960,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1345136-what-do-you-think-of-these-ideas-for-aberrant?p=1356097#post1356097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was talking to my friend last night and she suggested what if Corbin had another official girlfriend (maybe a nova or even a Talent) and that's why they have to keep it a secret.<br /> <br /> I kind of like it. What do you guys think?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's good, but the biggest thing is to make sure there's a plausible reason for the PCs to care about any of this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T05:21:11-08:00","id":1357026,"title":"","content":"True...all but one are guys so they might not really care if Corbin and Slider are hot...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T09:38:23-08:00","id":1357061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1345136-what-do-you-think-of-these-ideas-for-aberrant?p=1357026#post1357026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">True...all but one are guys so they might not really care if Corbin and Slider are hot...</div> </div> </div> </div>As a straight white male, I'll tell you right now that Beyonc\u00e9 and Jay Z are hot. So is Chadwick Boseman. If Beyonce dumped Jay Z and got together with Boseman (or Jay Z dumped her and got with Boseman), however titillating it might be in terms of gossip, etc, it would be absolutely irrelevant to my life. The only way it becomes relevant to my life is if Beyonc\u00e9 dumps them both to start dating me.<br /> <br /> Right now the love lives of Corbin and Slider seem to be background gossip. Your players are not going to care about the love/sex lives of your celebrity NPCs. Unless it matters to them. If one of your PCs is the &quot;official love interest&quot; to Slider and stands to lose money or be embarrassed when Slider and Corbin get caught fooling around, it will matter. If another PC has Corbin (or Slider) as one of his Path Contacts and Corbin/Slider needs a &quot;huge favor&quot; it will again matter. Or, hell, one or both of your players are <i>playing</i> Slider and/or Corbin as their characters. Then it will damn sure matter to them.<br /> <br /> Players care about the stuff they're involved with. If &quot;Nova Tony Stark&quot; develops some cool bit of Q-Tech, big whoop. If Nova Tony Stark hires the characters to guard that piece of Q-Tech from theft and/or retrieve it when it eventually gets stolen (or &quot;Nova Justin Hammer&quot; hires them to swipe it), then it matters to them because it's part of <i>their</i> story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":". 12-26-2019, 12:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T19:01:03-08:00","id":1357147,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> these are all really great ideas. Thank you \ud83d\ude0a.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-27T12:26:12-08:00","id":1357232,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> I talked to my friend who\u2019s been doing this a lot longer than I have and he agrees with you. He said you need to get the players personally involved in your NPCs\u2019 love lives or they won\u2019t care otherwise. Thanks for the advice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T03:26:17-08:00","id":1357734,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1345136-what-do-you-think-of-these-ideas-for-aberrant?p=1357061#post1357061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As a straight white male, I'll tell you right now that Beyonc\u00e9 and Jay Z are hot. So is Chadwick Boseman. If Beyonce dumped Jay Z and got together with Boseman (or Jay Z dumped her and got with Boseman), however titillating it might be in terms of gossip, etc, it would be absolutely irrelevant to my life. The only way it becomes relevant to my life is if Beyonc\u00e9 dumps them both to start dating me.<br /> <br /> Right now the love lives of Corbin and Slider seem to be background gossip. Your players are not going to care about the love/sex lives of your celebrity NPCs. Unless it matters to them. If one of your PCs is the &quot;official love interest&quot; to Slider and stands to lose money or be embarrassed when Slider and Corbin get caught fooling around, it will matter. If another PC has Corbin (or Slider) as one of his Path Contacts and Corbin/Slider needs a &quot;huge favor&quot; it will again matter. Or, hell, one or both of your players are <i>playing</i> Slider and/or Corbin as their characters. Then it will damn sure matter to them.<br /> <br /> Players care about the stuff they're involved with. If &quot;Nova Tony Stark&quot; develops some cool bit of Q-Tech, big whoop. If Nova Tony Stark hires the characters to guard that piece of Q-Tech from theft and/or retrieve it when it eventually gets stolen (or &quot;Nova Justin Hammer&quot; hires them to swipe it), then it matters to them because it's part of <i>their</i> story.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or if the higher-ups in Aeon or Utopia get the PCs to investigate and/or cover up a potential scandal.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T05:04:11-08:00","id":1357744,"title":"","content":"@muon that works too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-08T04:11:47-08:00","id":1359685,"title":"","content":"I decided to make Andre\u2019s official girlfriend a beautiful Brazilian nova named Desconhecida (I borrowed the name from my friend) with emotion control and the ability to make people hallucinate by looking at the swirling multicolored patterns on her skin, plus probably a couple Mega-Attributes. We won\u2019t be playing Aberrant for a while, so I have time to work out the details.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-08T17:41:43-08:00","id":1359808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1345136-what-do-you-think-of-these-ideas-for-aberrant?p=1359685#post1359685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I decided to make Andre\u2019s official girlfriend a beautiful Brazilian nova named Desconhecida (I borrowed the name from my friend) with emotion control and the ability to make people hallucinate by looking at the swirling multicolored patterns on her skin, plus probably a couple Mega-Attributes. We won\u2019t be playing Aberrant for a while, so I have time to work out the details.</div> </div> </div> </div>How are the PCs connected to Andre and/or Slider and/or Desconhecida? Because right now it's still a bit tabloid. &quot;Oh, look, Andre Corbin is dating somebody whose costume is butt floss. Okie-dokie then. Moving on, anybody got any leads on stuff we care about?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":". 01-08-2020, 08:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-08T17:49:06-08:00","id":1359810,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> damn! This is harder than I thought. But thanks. I\u2019ll figure it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-08T17:56:11-08:00","id":1359813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1345136-what-do-you-think-of-these-ideas-for-aberrant?p=1359810#post1359810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> damn! This is harder than I thought. But thanks. I\u2019ll figure it out.</div> </div> </div> </div>She's a Brazilian Nova. Eufiber is a thing. We all know damn well she's wearing a thong. AKA Butt Floss.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-08T17:57:47-08:00","id":1359814,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> she would look good in a Eufiber thong...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T06:13:45-08:00","id":1359886,"title":"","content":"I think you really need to decide whether you want to do a story or an adventure, because they aren't the same thing. You can do a story. Just write your bit of fan-fiction about Corbin, Slider and Butt-Floss Girl in their love/lust triangle set in the Nova age. Then publish it on fanfiction.net and you'll probably get some readers/fans.<br /> <br /> But if you want to do an adventure, you need to make sure you've set plenty of hooks for your players. You set initial conditions and then react to what your player do with them. You'll need to be prepared for your players to do stuff you didn't want or expect. Maybe Slider gets kicked off T2M. Or Corbin gets arrested. Or Slider, Corbin and Butt-Floss Girl get killed because the PCs &quot;solve&quot; the issue by going full &quot;murder hobo.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T04:18:28-08:00","id":1360097,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> I would love to do it as a game, but idk if I\u2019ll get the chance to. I\u2019ve never actually run a game before. But I guess I could write it as a story and post it on FanFiction. Thanks for your help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T08:21:08-08:00","id":1360125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1345136-what-do-you-think-of-these-ideas-for-aberrant?p=1360097#post1360097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> I would love to do it as a game, but idk if I\u2019ll get the chance to. I\u2019ve never actually run a game before. But I guess I could write it as a story and post it on FanFiction. Thanks for your help.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're welcome. The thing for me is that you seem to be very interested in the characters of Andre, Slider and this story of their forbidden love. The thing about a game is that the players are going to be much more interested in their own characters' stories.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T10:52:14-08:00","id":1360161,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> yeah, I guess. Maybe a story would work better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T13:36:20-08:0